    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahasiya sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga bea ng'eanyiida Yerusalemu niimbiit orjeeda mwanang' bea Ahasiya ghoah sugoocheanda gawa hoorgeadaanyi; aba gideaba gheamughuushcheanda gheareemanga adeanyi sea fuga Araba ea ghapka jeeda maheemajeanda ea ninuuseada orjooga hees sean. Hean goombaliischi Ahasiyaheeda was orjeeda Yehoramu was sugoocheanda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Ahasiya gaba gweanyeew diktam ea iyeenya damanda ang'eada gheambalmeeda, hean goombaliischi gwanyagi aba Yerusalemu. Gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Adaliya, nea hudeaba orjeeda Omrihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean eara niny ghwaat naweadinga gheeh Ahabu, aba gideaba ghaamwat dea argweakiisa niny aba sinooda ng'asheega munyasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin riing'eeda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, gawuurji gida ghayi sin gheeh Ahabu; iidu nea ning'ata miyeeda ghwaan ghwanung' ghoah saawa fuga jea goorgweakiisa niny, bwak ea ghoabeada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean inyeesa ghwaat geeshta girgweaguutka nyaawa, aba ng'ata goodeayi sea Yehoramu was orjeeda Ahabuheeda was sugoocheanda Israeli gaweay gang'uchi sea Hasaeli was sugoocheanda Shaamu aba Ramoti Gileyadi. Ak hean fuga Shaamu gwasawan Yoram, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gabiigu eahaap aba Yesreeli deaneaduutka ghayi nyas aba Rama damanda ng'uchi sea Hasaeli was sugoocheanda Shaamu. Nea Ahasiya was orjeeda Yehoramu was sugoocheanda Yuda ghwararang'aada gawa heeda Yoram was orjeeda Ahabu aba Yesreeli aba gideaba ghamnyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba goola ghwaloat ASEETA giibeedeayda Ahasiya gayghawunu damanda beawa gwaroonyi sea Yoram. Iidu nea ghwahita jarooda sea Yehoramu gwaroonyi sea Yehu was orjeeda Nimshi, was dea nimwaar NG'UTAMIIDA ghoah siichea gahuuyda gheeh Ahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwalach Yehu girgweageeda aba badayda gheeh Ahabu, gwaroonyi sea fuga hees bea Yuda sea orjooga bea ghweanagi sea Ahasiya, nea gagadiiyeesa Ahasiya, hean ghabwar goosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gagaseada Ahasiya, hean geang'waay nea gudu ghafuy geaw aba Samariya, ng'ata geeyeadu heeda Yehu ng'ata geabwar ghami. Hean geebuy, nea gwayeena, “Yehoshafati gheamba ghwaan gil, was dea ghayi gaseada NG'UTAMIIDA aba gurooroadaanyi sean.” Nea aba gheeh Ahasiya ea manda eara siyagi ammu ghoang'waay gheambalmeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gatmooda was sugoocheanda siguura Adaliya bea Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iinidaah Adaliyaheeda was gheamata Ahasiya gideaba nimi orjeedaanyi, hean ghang'eat ak gahuuyda fuga sean bea gheeda sugoocheanda bea gheeh Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Yehosheba was huda sugoocheanda, gageanda Yoashi was orjeeda Ahasiya, aba ng'ata geang'aamwa jeeda orjooga sugoocheanda was gea jea eenuus goosha, aba ng'ata ghwayiin niny sea huda jea ghoarear aba jeeda ghooriida. Hean Yehosheba was huda sugoocheanda siguura Yehoramu sea gatmooda Yehoyada was ashoohoocheanda, aba gideaba niny huda geenyea Ahasiya gil, hean geafuy aba heeda Adaliya, ea mabwara ghami; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gwandeayi sea saawa gweanyeew lah, nea geafunya jeeda gheeda ASEETA, damanda ambal ng'eanyiida Adaliya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
